# Diving in first person (a tester, 0.1.17: "how do you dive, go down in the water?"). Ratchet put in Novalis's water
# treads it at the surface. The left trigger (the crouch) dives him (before 0.1.17 only both palms pushing the water up
# or a swing did); under the water he goes where the head looks with the stick pushed. Run with QUEST_SWIM_TRACE=1
# QUEST_STATE_TRACE=1: the swim lines give his height (z), which goes down looking down and up looking up.
600 y 1
606 y 0
3300 shot treading
3340 left_trigger 1
3400 left_trigger 0
3500 shot dived
# Under: look down and push the stick.
3520 head_pitch -40
3540 left_y 1
3700 left_y 0
3710 shot looked-down
# Look up and push the stick.
3720 head_pitch 40
3740 left_y 1
3900 left_y 0
3910 head_pitch 0
3920 shot looked-up
4000 quit 0
